{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":32,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"5aa53bb5-e5cb-4200-8cfb-ae2e2e72323f","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":311195174,"PostDateInt":1792461325000,"PostDate":"2026-10-20T09:55:25","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"电力电子产品测试工程师(J13936)","OrgId":0,"Org":"默认部门","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["浙江省·嘉兴市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1、负责SSCB、APF/SVG、储能PCS、逆变器、DC/DC、充电桩等电力电子产品的功能、性能、电气安全与可靠性测试方案制定与执行。\n2、负责整机测试环境搭建与调试，包括电气主回路、控制与驱动回路、采样与保护回路，保障测试安全、稳定、可复现。\n3、负责电气防护与EMC电磁兼容测试（如浪涌、CS、RS等）、高低温等环境可靠性测试、长期老化测试等。\n4、负责参照标准与需求，完成编写测试用例、测试流程、测试报告，输出产品优化建议、风险评估，协助问题定位分析。\n5、能有Python或LabVIEW等完成测试自动化编程基础，提升测试效率与一致性。\n6、负责参与测试体系建设，完善电力电子产品测试规范、可靠性标准与数据管理流程，协助产品迭代与国产化替代。\n7、完成领导交办的其他测试相关工作。","Require":"1、本科及以上学历，电力电子、电气工程、电子信息、自动化等相关专业。\n2、了解电力电子拓扑，了解APF/SVG、储能PCS、逆变器、充电桩等产品的核心功能与控制逻辑。\n3、熟悉 EMC、绝缘防护、环境可靠性等相关测试标准，能独立测试、接线、执行，保障测试安全可靠。\n4、能使用示波器、功率电源、直流源/载、EMC测试设备、温控箱等测试仪器；\n5、有较好的阅读英文文档的能力，熟悉至少一种自动化测试编程工具：\n6、有较好的交流沟通能力及较强的文档编写能力；\n7、学习能力强，对技术有热情，积极并有强烈责任心。\n\n1、有3年及以上电力电子整机产品测试相关工作经验者优先。\n2、有EMC、电气安全、环境可靠性等测试完整项目经验，熟悉 GB/T、IEC 等相关行业标准者优先。\n3、有测试平台搭建、自动化测试开发、问题定位与分析经验者优先。\n4、有型式试验、第三方检测机构对接经验者优先。","ClassificationOne":"技术类","ClassificationTwo":"嘉兴","Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"3年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-20T09:55:25","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"5259d59d-46bd-4a44-9069-91ceeeb91dba","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":311195159,"PostDateInt":1792460323000,"PostDate":"2026-10-20T09:38:43","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"app研发工程师(J13937)","OrgId":0,"Org":"默认部门","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["浙江省·嘉兴市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1.负责网关协议数据采集对接开发，熟悉Modbus（TCP/RTU）、IEC 60870-5-104等主流通信协议；\n2.负责Android原生程序开发，主要用于低压柜、中压柜屏端程序（人机交互界面、数据展示与参数设置）；\n3.负责UniApp跨端程序开发，主要支撑天正安全云、天正微电网等项目的开发与迭代；\n4.参与移动端架构设计、性能优化与版本迭代，与后端、硬件、算法团队协同联调；\n5.积极推进移动端多端能力（Android、iOS、鸿蒙）建设与落地，结合业务场景持续优化用户体验与稳定性；","Require":"专业技能\t\n1.统招本科及以上学历，计算机、软件工程、自动化、电子信息等相关专业；\n2.熟悉Android原生开发（Java/Kotlin），熟悉四大组件、自定义View、网络通信及Android Studio等主流开发工具；\n3.熟悉UniApp跨平台开发框架，具备HBuilderX多端编译、打包与上架经验；\n4.熟悉HTTP/HTTPS、WebSocket、MQTT等网络协议，对Modbus等工业通信协议有一定了解；\n5.熟悉iOS（Objective-C/Swift）或鸿蒙（ArkTS）开发，或具备大型Flutter/跨端应用完整研发经验者优先；\n6.具备良好的代码规范、调试与性能优化能力，熟悉Linux开发环境者优先；\n相关经验\t\n1.熟悉智能配电、低压柜/中压柜屏端、微电网相关业务或有产品设计经验者优先；\n2.有网关协议对接（Modbus、104规约等）或工业物联网（IoT）数据采集开发经验者优先；\n3.具有UniApp多端项目实际开发经验，具备Android原生应用从0到1的开发、上架与迭代经验者优先；\n4.具备iOS、鸿蒙多端开发经验，或熟悉电力行业屏端人机交互产品者优先；","ClassificationOne":"技术类","ClassificationTwo":"嘉兴","Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"3年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-20T09:38:43","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"9969bece-2f73-4a4f-9966-0494e02f5fd7","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":311193947,"PostDateInt":1792047320000,"PostDate":"2026-10-15T14:55:20","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"电力电子结构工程师(J13935)","OrgId":0,"Org":"默认部门","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["浙江省·嘉兴市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1. 负责电力电子相关产品的整机与功率单元柜体结构、冷板及液冷管路方案设计、三维建模与工程出图；\n2. 完成整机散热、液冷系统设计与热仿真校核，负责高压柜体强度、抗震、绝缘安全设计；\n3. 协同电气、电子团队完成整机布局，兼顾高低压分区与EMC屏蔽；\n4. 完成BOM清单、工程图纸，跟进整机与零部件打样。\n5. 配合团队完成样机装配，解决渗漏、过热、凝露、振动等问题，参与高低温、振动、IP 防护型式试验整改。\n6. 液冷零部件选型、成本与标准化优化，对接供应商，处理现场柜体、液冷相关故障整改。\n7. 完成领导交办的其他硬件开发相关工作。","Require":"1. 本科及以上，机械设计、热能工程、动力工程等相关专业；\n2. 有3年以上大功率电力设备结构设计经验，具备液冷系统开发经验；\n3. 熟练SolidWorks/Creo、AutoCAD，熟悉钣金、机加工工艺与高压绝缘规范；\n4. 能独立完成样机问题定位，掌握振动、IP、凝露防护设计。\n\n1. 有高压变频器、级联PCS、SVG、电力变压器等大功率电力设备液冷项目实战经验者优先；\n2. 有FloTHERM/Icepak热仿真软件，可完成冷板与整机流体热仿真设计者优先；\n3. 有高压柜国标，有柜体抗震、运输冲击、型式试验整改经验者优先；\n4. 有冷板、功率母排、绝缘支撑件设计经验者优先；\n5. 有液冷、防腐、钣金喷涂、管路减振、防凝露设计经验者优先；","ClassificationOne":"技术类","ClassificationTwo":"嘉兴","Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"3年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-15T14:55:20","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"a901382d-33b3-467c-8a1f-04c10a1f0d19","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":311193943,"PostDateInt":1792046483000,"PostDate":"2026-10-15T14:41:23","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"电力电子FPGA 工程师(J13934)","OrgId":0,"Org":"默认部门","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["浙江省·嘉兴市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1.负责产品主控与功率单元光纤通信 FPGA 开发，完成帧协议、多单元同步、CRC校验、故障上报、链路容错逻辑开发，保障高压强 EMI 场景下多单元稳定实时通信。\n2.开发功率单元 FPGA 逻辑，实现采样采集、故障保护、辅助 PWM 逻辑；\n3.完成 Verilog RTL 编码、仿真与时序收敛，解决跨时钟域等数字电路问题。\n4.参与硬件评审与样机调试，定位通信、时序、电磁干扰类板级故障；\n5.跨团队完成整机联调，输出技术文档、测试报告。\n6.参与EMC、可靠性试验整改，代码版本维护，持续优化逻辑性能，支撑产品迭代。\n7.完成领导交办的其他硬件开发相关工作。","Require":"